<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <%- include('partials/head') %>
  <title>NEXORA 2026 — Emerging Technology & Interdisciplinary Innovation Conference</title>
</head>
<body>
  <%- include('partials/nav') %>

  <!-- ============ HERO ============ -->
      <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <div class="hero-text">
        <p class="eyebrow" style="color: var(--accent-cream);">Welcome to</p>
        <h1 style="font-size: 44px; color: #fff; margin: 4px 0 16px; font-family: 'Georgia', serif; letter-spacing: 0.5px;">
          <span style="color: var(--accent-light);">NEXORA</span> <span style="font-weight: 400;">2026</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="eyebrow" style="margin-bottom: 6px;">Emerging Technology & Interdisciplinary Innovation Student Conference</p>
        <p class="hero-subtitle" style="font-size: 17px; max-width: 480px; margin: 12px 0 32px; font-style: italic;">
          "Emerging Technologies and Interdisciplinary Innovations for a Sustainable Future"
        </p>
        <a href="/register" id="hero-register-btn" class="btn btn-primary" style="margin-right: 12px;">Register Now →</a>
          <a href="/downloads/NEXORA_2026_Rulebook.pdf" target="_blank" class="btn-link" style="color:#fff;">View Rulebook</a>
        </div>
      <div class="hero-graphic" aria-hidden="true">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 300 300" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <circle cx="150" cy="150" r="90" fill="none" stroke="#24B1B1" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <circle cx="150" cy="150" r="60" fill="none" stroke="#FFE2AF" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <line x1="150" y1="150" x2="230" y2="90" stroke="#24B1B1" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <line x1="150" y1="150" x2="70" y2="80" stroke="#24B1B1" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <line x1="150" y1="150" x2="220" y2="230" stroke="#FFE2AF" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <line x1="150" y1="150" x2="60" y2="220" stroke="#24B1B1" stroke-width="1.5"/>
          <circle cx="150" cy="150" r="8" fill="#FFE2AF"/>
          <circle cx="230" cy="90" r="6" fill="#24B1B1"/>
          <circle cx="70" cy="80" r="5" fill="#24B1B1"/>
          <circle cx="220" cy="230" r="6" fill="#FFE2AF"/>
          <circle cx="60" cy="220" r="5" fill="#24B1B1"/>
        </svg>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div> 

    
 

 
  <!-- ============ ABOUT THE EVENT ============ -->
  <div class="container" id="about" style="padding-top: 72px;">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <p class="eyebrow">About Us</p>
      <h2>Transforming <span class="heading-accent">Ideas into Research</span></h2>
            <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 16px;">
        NEXORA – Emerging Technology and Interdisciplinary Innovation Conference 2026 is a research-focused academic conference organized to provide students with a platform to explore, develop, and present innovative research ideas in emerging technologies and interdisciplinary domains.
      </p>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 16px; margin-top:16px;">
        The conference encourages students to go beyond conventional classroom learning by engaging in research, critical thinking, innovation, problem-solving, and technical communication. Participants will have the opportunity to present their research through an initial abstract and poster submission, followed by a final research paper presentation for shortlisted participants.
      </p>
      <p style="color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 16px; margin-top:16px;">
        NEXORA aims to bring together students with diverse technical and interdisciplinary interests and encourage them to address real-world challenges through innovative research and emerging technologies.
      </p>
                  <div class="event-info-row">
        <div class="info-box-h">
          <div class="info-box-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2"></rect><line x1="16" y1="2" x2="16" y2="6"></line><line x1="8" y1="2" x2="8" y2="6"></line><line x1="3" y1="10" x2="21" y2="10"></line></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="info-box-label">Conference Day</div>
            <div class="info-box-value">14 Oct 2026</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-box-h">
          <div class="info-box-icon">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M21 10c0 7-9 13-9 13s-9-6-9-13a9 9 0 0 1 18 0z"></path><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"></circle></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <div class="info-box-label">Venue</div>
            <div class="info-box-value">APJ Abdul Kalam Auditorium</div>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="info-box-h">
          <div class="info-box-icon" style="font-size:22px; font-weight:800;">₹</div>
          <div>
            <div class="info-box-label">Registration Fee</div>
            <div class="info-box-value">₹100 per person</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ============ ABOUT COLLEGE + CLUBS ============ -->
  <div class="section-alt host-section">
    <div class="container" style="padding-bottom:0;">
      <p class="eyebrow">Host Institution</p>
      <h2 style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px;">
        <img src="/images/hindustan-college-logo.png" alt="Hindustan College of Science & Technology" style="height:40px; width:auto;">
        <span>Hindustan College of <span class="heading-accent">Science & Technology</span></span>
      </h2>
      <p style="max-width: 720px; color: var(--text-secondary); font-size: 16px;">
        A NAAC A+ accredited institution under the Sharda Group, Farah, Mathura — committed to fostering research, innovation, and interdisciplinary learning among students. This college is amongst the first self-financed colleges in North India, affiliated to Dr. APJ Abdul Kalam Technical University (AKTU), Lucknow and approved by All India Council for Technical Education (AICTE), New Delhi.
      </p>
      <div class="icon-card-grid" style="margin-top:32px;">
        <div class="card icon-card">
          <img src="/images/byte-logo.png" alt="Byte Club logo" style="width:65px; height:65px; border-radius:12px; object-fit:contain; background:#fff; padding:4px; margin-bottom:14px;">
          <h3>Byte Club</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:13px; font-weight:600; margin:-4px 0 10px;">CSE Department</p>
          <p style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:14px;">Byte Club is the Computer Science Society of HCST, focused on building technical skills, problem-solving ability, innovation, leadership, and professional readiness through workshops, competitions, hackathons, technical events, mentorship, and career-oriented initiatives.</p>
          <p style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:13px; font-style:italic; margin-top:10px;">Under the guidance of Mr. Gaurav Pandey — Faculty Coordinator, Byte Club</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card icon-card">
          <img src="/images/qubit-logo.jpeg" alt="Qubit Tech Society logo" style="width:85px; height:80px; border-radius:15px; object-fit:contain; background:#fff; padding:0px; margin-bottom:6px;"><h3>Qubit Club</h3>
          <p style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:13px; font-weight:600; margin:-4px 0 10px;">IT Department</p>
          <p style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:14px;">Qubit Club is the Information Technology Club of HCST, focused on technology, innovation, and practical IT skills. It provides students with opportunities to explore emerging technologies through workshops, competitions, and hands-on activities.</p>
          <p style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:13px; font-style:italic; margin-top:10px;">Under the guidance of Mr. Utkarsh Gupta — Faculty Coordinator, Qubit Club</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <!-- ============ RESEARCH TRACKS ============ -->
  <div class="container" id="tracks">
    <p class="eyebrow">Our Tracks</p>
    <h2>Research Tracks We <span class="heading-accent">Welcome</span></h2>
        <div class="icon-card-grid">
      <div class="card icon-card">
        <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="22" height="22"><rect x="4" y="4" width="16" height="16" rx="2"></rect><rect x="9" y="9" width="6" height="6"></rect><line x1="9" y1="1" x2="9" y2="4"></line><line x1="15" y1="1" x2="15" y2="4"></line><line x1="9" y1="20" x2="9" y2="23"></line><line x1="15" y1="20" x2="15" y2="23"></line><line x1="20" y1="9" x2="23" y2="9"></line><line x1="20" y1="15" x2="23" y2="15"></line><line x1="1" y1="9" x2="4" y2="9"></line><line x1="1" y1="15" x2="4" y2="15"></line></svg></div>
        <h3>AI/ML</h3><p style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:14px;">Machine learning, deep learning, generative AI, NLP, computer vision, responsible AI.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card icon-card">
        <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="22" height="22"><line x1="18" y1="20" x2="18" y2="10"></line><line x1="12" y1="20" x2="12" y2="4"></line><line x1="6" y1="20" x2="6" y2="14"></line></svg></div>
        <h3>Data Science</h3><p style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:14px;">Data analysis, visualization, big data, predictive analytics, data privacy.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card icon-card">
        <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="22" height="22"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"></polygon></svg></div>
        <h3>Emerging Tech</h3><p style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:14px;">IoT, cloud & edge computing, blockchain, cybersecurity, AR/VR, robotics.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card icon-card">
        <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="22" height="22"><path d="M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z"></path><path d="M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12"></path></svg></div>
        <h3>Sustainable Tech</h3><p style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:14px;">Green computing, renewable energy, smart cities, climate technology.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="card icon-card">
        <div class="icon-badge"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" width="22" height="22"><polygon points="12 2 2 7 12 12 22 7 12 2"></polygon><polyline points="2 17 12 22 22 17"></polyline><polyline points="2 12 12 17 22 12"></polyline></svg></div>
        <h3>Interdisciplinary</h3><p style="color:var(--text-secondary); font-size:14px;">Technology in education, healthcare, agriculture, social innovation, HCI.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ============ STAGES & TIMELINE ============ -->
     <!-- ============ STAGES & TIMELINE ============ -->
  <div class="section-alt">
    <div class="container" style="padding-bottom: 64px;">
      <p class="eyebrow">Process</p>
      <h2>Stages & <span class="heading-accent">Timeline</span></h2>

      <div class="stages-timeline">
        <div class="timeline-line" id="timeline-line"></div>

        <div class="stage-item">
          <div class="stage-date"><span class="stage-day">30</span><span class="stage-month">Sep</span></div>
          <div class="stage-card">
            <div class="stage-time">30 Sept 2026, 11:59 PM IST</div>
            <h3>Abstract & Poster Submission Deadline</h3>
            <p>All registered participants must submit their abstract and research poster before this deadline, across one of the 5 research tracks.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="stage-item">
          <div class="stage-date"><span class="stage-day">08</span><span class="stage-month">Oct</span></div>
          <div class="stage-card">
            <div class="stage-time">8 October 2026</div>
            <h3>Acceptance Notification</h3>
            <p>Shortlisted participants will be notified by email and informed of the next steps for Round 2.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="stage-item">
          <div class="stage-date"><span class="stage-day">12</span><span class="stage-month">Oct</span></div>
          <div class="stage-card">
            <div class="stage-time">12 October 2026</div>
            <h3>Research Paper Submission Deadline</h3>
            <p>Selected participants submit their complete research paper ahead of the final presentation round.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="stage-item">
          <div class="stage-date"><span class="stage-day">14</span><span class="stage-month">Oct</span></div>
          <div class="stage-card">
            <div class="stage-time">14 October 2026, 10:00 AM – 5:00 PM</div>
            <h3>Conference Day</h3>
            <p>Final research paper presentations before the evaluation committee at the A.P.J Abdul Kalam Auditorium, HCST.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
